{"agent":"fx-claims","data":{"by":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","evidence":{"chunk_findings":[{"chunk":1,"detail":"The new fallback `have = list(prior.globs or (parked.globs if parked is not None else []))` uses `parked` instead of the caller’s own prior live lease when `prior.globs` is empty. `parked` is the existing parked lease, not the lease being renewed, so a live-holder re-claim with an empty prior coverage and a non-None parked lease either inherits the wrong other lease’s globs (for example the previous holder’s `[\"old.py\"]`), or raises `TypeError: 'NoneType' object is not iterable` if that parked lease’s `globs` is `None`. The included regression test does not exercise this branch because its `prior.globs` is non-empty, so `parked` is short-circuited away.","digest":"472b41c77c94ae0e","location":"ddflow/api/lifecycle/claim.py:246","severity":"MEDIUM","title":"ddflow/api/lifecycle/claim.py:246"}],"chunks_total":1,"coverage":"1/1 chunk(s) reviewed","delta_rounds":0,"diff_chars":2666,"diff_sha":"1b45f4d9d98d85a03be20996d8a8e25e83188aade3fcaa86591499e31a27260e","diff_source":"main..HEAD + tracked working-tree changes in [REDACTED:path]","diff_stat":{"deletions":0,"files":0,"insertions":0,"untracked":0},"elapsed_s":407.6,"family":"deepseek","findings":1,"max_chunk_chars":5000,"model":"deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813-Godzila","output_digest":"9f9e56ab555ce3e5","output_file":".ddflow/local/reviews/fix-Bf22edc42d5.rubber_duck.lan-deepseek-v4-pro.20261022T101657Z-3682b448.jsonl","reason":"","review_kind":"full","reviewed":[1],"reviewed_head":"8aa06df81d54c5e384909d2db5d55240afe301d0","reviewed_paths":{"ddflow/api/lifecycle/claim.py":"100644 e76b7c8237a1b41330b0347450d9431be2eadb1c","tests/test_claim_held_globs_add.py":"100644 b13e0aa2898bb15e0f78a8e8a35e592864dff2e9"},"reviewer":"lan-deepseek-v4-pro","reviewer_digest":"dd08c1466c2b8632","round":1,"rounds":1,"status":"REVIEWED","titles":["ddflow/api/lifecycle/claim.py:246"],"tree_sha":"8aa06df81d54+c